      "description": {
        "fun": "Blastoise is a turtle crossed with a tank: two water cannons slide out of its shell and fire jets that can punch through steel and concrete, and it makes itself heavy to brace against the recoil. It can even fly by jetting water out of the back of its shell. Base Set Blastoise has its own place in card history as the first Pokémon on the English Trading Card Game's test prints.",
        "guide": "The final stage of Squirtle's line, a large turtle Pokémon with two water cannons on its shell that fire jets strong enough to pierce steel. It makes its body heavy to withstand the recoil and can even propel itself through the air. Blastoise can Mega Evolve into Mega Blastoise and has a Gigantamax form.",
        "tagline": "A tank of a turtle with water cannons on its shell",
